      "updated": 1791733370291,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "on a naive first pass, we will need:\n\n[1] set pin <x> <0/1>\n[2] branch if pin <x> <0/1>\n[3] branch if reg <x> <0/1>\n[4] jump\n[5] wait\n[5] sum_buff? add?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "on a naive first pass, we will need:\n\n[1] set pin <x> <0/1>\n[2] branch if pin <x> <0/1>\n[3] branch if reg <x> <0/1>\n[4] jump\n[5] wait\n[5] sum_buff? add?",
      "autoResize": true,
